irene: lovely. final checklist: - add CHANGELOG entry: "docs: tolerant parsing of Retry-After headers in snippets; moved repro to mock server" - update contributing guide with pre-merge step: run docs/tests/run_snippets locally and grep for header names used by runtime.

tao: added changelog blurb and contributing note, squashed commits, merged PR. closing thread. :shipit:
